{"id": "86305", "name": "מד\"ר מדויקת – ערך הפרמטר k שעבורו המשוואה מדויקת (ב) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>For what values of k is the following differential equation exact? \\[ ( {{CT:0}} ) \\frac{dy}{dx} + {{CT:1}} = 0.\\] <br /> k = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>As the differential equation\\[ ( {{CT:0}} ) \\frac{d y}{dx} + {{CT:1}} = 0\\] is of the form \\[A(x,y)\\frac{dy}{dx} + B(x,y) = 0\\] the condition for the differential equation to be exact is \\[\\frac{A(x,y)}{x} = \\frac{B(x,y)}{y}\\] Therefore \\[{{CT:2}}={{CT:3}}\\] \\[k={{CT:4}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Mk", "Nk", "P1", "PO", "Pk", "correctanswer", "diffMk", "diffNk", "nk"], "nvariants": 50}